# Plan

Tech stack: Django 5.0 + PostgreSQL + Bootstrap 5.

Note: T0 (init empty project + passing test) is auto-generated by SA.
Do not write it manually unless you want to customize it.

## User system

> Issue template:
> - Title: Create User and Household models
> - Acceptance:
>     - User has fields: email (unique), password_hash, household FK
>     - Household has fields: name, invite_code (8 chars, unique), default_interval (int, default 7)
>     - Running `uv run pytest tests/test_models.py` passes
> - Files: users/models.py, users/migrations/
> - Depends: []

> Issue template:
> - Title: Signup with invite code
> - Acceptance:
>     - POST /signup with valid invite code creates user + joins existing household
>     - POST /signup with invalid code returns HTTP 400 and shows visible error
>     - POST /signup without invite code creates new household
>     - User is redirected to /dashboard after success
> - Files: users/views.py, users/forms.py, users/templates/signup.html
> - Depends: T1

> Issue template:
> - Title: Login / Logout
> - Acceptance:
>     - Valid credentials redirect to /dashboard
>     - Invalid credentials show error, stay on login page
>     - Logout redirects to /
> - Files: users/views.py, config/urls.py
> - Depends: T1

## Chore management

> Issue template:
