> - Acceptance:
>     - Authenticated user can create chore with fields: name, category, difficulty (easy/medium/hard), assignee
>     - User can edit and delete own chores
>     - User cannot edit chores from other households
>     - `uv run pytest tests/test_chore_views.py` passes
> - Files: chores/models.py, chores/views.py, chores/templates/chore_form.html
> - Depends: T1

> Issue template:
> - Title: Dashboard with Today/Upcoming/Overdue columns
> - Acceptance:
>     - Dashboard shows 3 columns: Today, Upcoming, Overdue
>     - Each column lists assignment cards with chore name + assignee
>     - Completed chores are excluded
>     - Unread notification count displayed in navbar
> - Files: chores/views.py, chores/templates/dashboard.html
> - Depends: T4, T2

> Issue template:
> - Title: Complete chore + auto-rotation
> - Acceptance:
>     - Clicking "Complete" marks assignment done
>     - Points awarded: easy=1, medium=2, hard=3
>     - Next partner is auto-assigned (fairness rule: lowest total points)
>     - Rotation is skipped if household is paused
> - Files: chores/views.py, chores/services.py
> - Depends: T4, T1

